---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Cleanthes — Hardened Android Vault Architecture" description="A security-focused, modular Android credential manager engineered with hardware attestation and Zero-Trust session lifecycles." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="stoic-hero">
				<blockquote class="stoic-quote">
					"FATE LEADS THE WILLING, AND DRAGS ALONG THE RELUCTANT."
					<footer>— CLEANTHES</footer>
				</blockquote>
				<h1>Cleanthes Application Showcase</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">HARDENED SECURITY VAULT | MULTI-MODULE ARCHITECTURE | ZERO-TRUST LIFECYCLE</p>
			</section>

			<hr />

			<section>
				<h2>EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW</h2>
				<p>
					<strong>Cleanthes</strong> is a native Android credential vault and security-focused management application built from first principles. Designed for zero-trust security environments, it combines hardware-backed biometric attestation, isolated session lifecycles, and modern Jetpack Compose UI rendering without sacrificing low-level performance or runtime safety.
				</p>
			</section>

			<hr />

			<section>
				<h2>MODULAR SYSTEM GRAPH</h2>
				<p>
					The application enforces strict architectural boundaries using a decoupled feature-and-core module graph. This prevents feature bleed and ensures compile-time dependency isolation:
				</p>
				<ul class="discipline-list">
					<li><strong>:core:security & :attestation:</strong> Hardware-backed cryptographic keys, Android KeyStore abstraction, and runtime attestation validation.</li>
					<li><strong>:core:security:session:</strong> Isolated session lifecycles managing memory-wipe mechanisms for raw credentials upon lock trigger.</li>
					<li><strong>:core:data & :domain:</strong> Room 2.7 persistence layer managed via Symbol Processing (KSP) with encrypted at-rest database instances.</li>
					<li><strong>:feature:autofill & :auditlog:</strong> Native Android Autofill Framework integration, audit logging, export pipelines, and biometrically protected credentials.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<hr />

			<section>
				<h2>ENGINEERING SPECS & TOOLCHAIN</h2>
				<ul class="discipline-list">
					<li><strong>UI Pipeline:</strong> Declarative Jetpack Compose UI with unidirectional state flows and Hilt injection.</li>
					<li><strong>Compiler & Runtime:</strong> Kotlin 2.2 toolchain, Java 17 JVM target, and KSP for compile-time code generation.</li>
					<li><strong>Release Hardening:</strong> Proguard/R8 code minification, resource shrinking, and backup prevention (`allowBackup = false`).</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

